{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world of Crypterion like never before with the digital artbook! This collection features 65 pages of original illustrations, including concepts not seen in the game.<br><br> The visuals were created by a variety of artists, each bringing their unique style and skill level. The artists had the freedom to choose which characters or scenes to illustrate, so you may notice certain characters appearing more frequently than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Please note: Some player-submitted fan art is exclusively viewable within the game. The planetary backgrounds were specially commissioned for the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>All artwork featured is artist-created\u2014no AI-generated art is included.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How do I access artbooks on Steam?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To locate the artbook on your computer after the purchase, find the game in your Steam Library and click &quot;Browse local files&quot; in the &quot;Manage&quot; dropdown menu.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626870?t=1745942397","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626870?t=1745942397","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626870/88e2ef5dbd9d85ecfaf3849d950ee2ad5ed936b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745942397","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626870/88e2ef5dbd9d85ecfaf3849d950ee2ad5ed936b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745942397","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world of Crypterion like never before with the digital artb